msgid ":class:`~zett_agent.events.AgentEvent`"
msgstr ":class:`~zett_agent.events.AgentEvent`"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:17
msgid "``await context.emit(...)``"
msgstr "``await context.emit(...)``"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:18
msgid "``Agent.stream`` and your dispatcher"
msgstr "``Agent.stream`` 和你的分发器"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:19
msgid "Anything the user should see"
msgstr "任何用户应该看到的内容"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:20
msgid ":class:`~zett_agent.extensions.events.ExtensionEvent`"
msgstr ":class:`~zett_agent.extensions.events.ExtensionEvent`"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:21
msgid "``await context.publish(...)``"
msgstr "``await context.publish(...)``"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:22
msgid "Other extensions' ``on_event``"
msgstr "其他扩展的 ``on_event``"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:23 ../../concepts/events.rst:50
msgid "Coordination between extensions"
msgstr "扩展之间的协调"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:24
msgid ":class:`~zett_agent.extensions.external.ExternalEvent`"
msgstr ":class:`~zett_agent.extensions.external.ExternalEvent`"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:25
msgid "``agent.emit_external_event(...)``"
msgstr "``agent.emit_external_event(...)``"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:26
msgid "An extension's ``accept``"
msgstr "某个扩展的 ``accept``"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:27
msgid "A reply from your UI back into a waiting request"
msgstr "你的 UI 回传给等待中请求的应答"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:30
msgid "UI output"
msgstr "UI 输出"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:32
msgid "Emit an ``AgentEvent`` for anything a person should see. A custom event carries a ``name`` and a ``payload`` you define, and the dispatcher calls ``on_custom_event``; the name is data, not a Python method."
msgstr "只要是人应该看到的内容，就发出一个 ``AgentEvent``\\ 。自定义事件会带上你自己定义的 ``name`` 和 ``payload``，分发器会调用 ``on_custom_event``；这个名称是数据，不是 Python 方法。"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:36
msgid "Streamed output arrives in a predictable order, so a UI can open and close loading states:"
msgstr "流式输出的到达顺序是可预期的，因此 UI 可以据此开启和结束加载状态："

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:46
msgid "An empty delta does not open a segment, and a failure or cancellation leaves the open segment without a completion — close your indicator in a ``finally`` block."
msgstr "空的增量不会开启一个片段；失败或取消会让已开启的片段没有结束事件——请在 ``finally`` 块里关闭你的指示器。"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:52
msgid "``context.publish`` notifies extensions, not the UI. Use it for things like \"history was compacted\" (:class:`~zett_agent.extensions.events.CompactionEvent`) or \"a message was appended\". Pass ``target=\"Name\"`` to reach one extension, or omit it to broadcast. An internal notification is never shown to the user automatically."
msgstr "``context.publish`` 通知的是扩展，不是 UI。它适合用来表示“历史记录已被压缩”（:class:`~zett_agent.extensions.events.CompactionEvent`）或“追加了一条消息”这类事情。传入 ``target=\"Name\"`` 可以只通知某一个扩展，省略它则广播。内部通知绝不会自动展示给用户。"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:59
msgid "Input from your UI"
msgstr "来自 UI 的输入"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:61
msgid "When the model asks a question or requests approval, the request pauses and your application replies with ``emit_external_event``. The reply must match the request's session ID and the expected event name and payload. If no extension accepts it, nothing happens and the request keeps waiting."
msgstr "当模型提出问题或请求审批时，请求会暂停，由你的应用用 ``emit_external_event`` 回复。这个应答必须与请求的会话 ID、预期的事件名称和负载相匹配。如果没有扩展接受它，什么都不会发生，请求会继续等待。"

#: ../../concepts/events.rst:66
msgid "See :doc:`../extending/events` to implement all three, or run the :doc:`approval round trip <../examples/approval>`."
msgstr "要自己实现这三类事件，参见\\ :doc:`../extending/events`；想跑一遍完整的审批流程，参见\\ :doc:`审批往返 <../examples/approval>`\\ 。"

